{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act17d0_level_act17d0_02_end",
  "groupId": "act17d0",
  "stageId": "act17d0_02",
  "title": "擴大防守範圍",
  "storyCode": "OD-2",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act17d0/level_act17d0_02_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "f53cd292b49aea6a80b9c37a39c097fea11cac6a7d10368a3928e235e67701b8",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "停火！小心平民！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "他們跑了，寇恩！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "別管了，保護其他人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "來人幫幫忙，這邊有人受傷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "先把他們抬進去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "醫生！你還好嗎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我在這兒！我沒事！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者鎮民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我的腿！我的腿斷了！我的腿！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "冷靜，你的腿還在，只是脫臼了，咬緊牙關。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者少女",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "媽媽......媽媽......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "誰看到阿爾加的媽媽了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重傷的鎮民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "救命......救......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "繃帶要不夠了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "混帳東西，*粗口*！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "那邊是不是著火了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "那個方向，是鎮中心？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "看來不只是這裡遭到襲擊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "為什麼，領主衛隊去哪兒了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "別管什麼領主衛隊了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "到處都是打鬥聲，事情變麻煩了，我們不能在這裡逗留，這裡太空曠了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "先把那幾個傷患抬到建築後面！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者鎮民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "怪物！怪物又來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者女性",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "救命啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "沒完沒了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "亞歷山大！你去屋頂掩護我們！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "來不及了醫生，我們必須離開這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可是我們能去哪兒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "先去你的診所。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那些感染者......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "別管那麼多，先讓所有人都去你的診所。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "來人搭把手！他走不動了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "科茨，你看看還有沒有其他人躲在屋子裡，再把這個社區的人都帶到診所去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "注意安全！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "......真是一場災難。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "四十多個人......所有人都在這裡了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我們救下的人......都在這裡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "少了多少人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不少人跑丟了，可能是去了鎮子那邊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但是有一些老人......他們來不及......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "別想了，不是你的錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "這些怪物，它們是從哪兒來的？它們是訓練過的戰獸嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不知道......我以前沒見過這種東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "那些暴徒掏出武器的時候，這些怪物就從地裡鑽出來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "別管它們是從哪兒來的，這些東西也太多了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "周圍的情況怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "一塌糊塗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "鎮子那邊有打鬥聲，我不確定發生了什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "我們還有多少彈藥？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "不多了，我還剩下四個彈匣，如果亞歷山大的彈藥用完了，我們就麻煩了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "彈藥問題還不是最要緊的，這間屋子快撐不住了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "憑那怪物的個頭，哪怕漏掉一兩個，它們都能撞穿這堵牆，我們是守不住的，得想想辦法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "醫生，病人的情況呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不少人受傷了，我只能簡單包紮一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "繃帶和酒精都不太夠了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "有沒有辦法先離開鎮子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "離開鎮子之後要去哪？帶著這麼多人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "沒有食物和水，他們跑到荒地上就是尋死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "我不覺得這些怪物會放棄襲擊我們。到了荒地情況只會更糟，沒有掩體，無法藏身，再加上我們都看見了它們的鑽地本事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我知道一個地方......說不定是安全的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "鎮南邊有一個很特殊的建築，可能是鎮上最安全的地方，和領主的大宅差不多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "詳細說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "以前有一個叫羅德島的醫療組織，在鎮子邊緣租了一塊地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "後來他們雇傭了工人，挖了不少土石，在那裡修建了很結實的屋子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......說不定是這裡最結實的屋子？看著像堡壘一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "你怎麼知道“羅德島”會願意幫助我們？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那間屋子只有一個看門人，我認識他，我從他那裡買過一些醫用補給。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "很多土石，多半是挖了地下室。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "聽起來像是雇傭兵的安全屋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "感覺很不可靠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "除非我們有更好的選擇，我建議去看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "沒食物沒水，守在這個土坯房子裡無異於等死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那個屋子在鎮子邊緣，我們可以從鎮外過去，這樣就不會被其他人看到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "......嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "科茨，你的盾牌還能用嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "半面盾，姑且能拿來揍人......應該。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "我需要一個人和我一起去，至少得有人保護醫生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "還是我去吧，大不了我替醫生擋子彈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "別說傻話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "我和科茨陪醫生去看看那個“安全屋”，蒂娜你留在這裡協助亞歷山大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "醫生，接下來無論發生什麼，一定要聽我指揮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "科茨，保護好醫生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "我會罩著他的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "沒看到燈光，好像沒人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "先別靠近，這屋子的門被砸開了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "連這裡也......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "這群暴徒的目的是什麼？和強盜土匪一樣打砸搶？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "救......救命......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "救命啊！誰都好！救救我啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我......我還不想死......可惡......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是那個看門人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "別動，你留在這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "我去看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......早知道就不做這份工作了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我不想死在這......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你是誰！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "不要亂動，你的腿斷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "雇......雇傭兵......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "別殺我！求求你！我說了我真的不知道鑰匙在哪！我只是個看門的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "相信我！我真的不知道！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "冷靜點！我是來幫你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你......你和那群人不是一夥的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "救救我！救救我啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "我說了！冷靜點！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "科茨！帶醫生過來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "奧克芬先生......你的腿......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你......你是那個感染者醫生！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "謝天謝地！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "別急，讓我看看你的腿......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "好傢伙，這屋子裡被翻了個底朝天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "房子裡面比外面看起來要小很多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "暗門、隔間、強化外牆，安全屋不都這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "這是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "無線電設備？都給砸成這樣了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "這麼大一台，有點復古啊。原來這個世界是有這種通訊設備的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "他們連汽車都有，有無線電也不奇怪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "我們之前住的破屋子裡還有別的“廢舊電器”呢，冰箱、風扇、熱水壺......雖然這些損毀物件裡沒有一個是真正通電的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "就和這個無線電台一樣，就和我們之前弄來的車一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "這些機器裡都有一個裝著黑色結晶的裝置，我估計那個就是這些設備的能源。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "痛痛痛！你輕點啊醫生！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "忍住！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......還好，不太嚴重，骨頭沒有斷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "你就是這裡的負責人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這裡是......羅德島駐外辦公室。我......我其實只是個看門的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "讓我猜猜，這些暴徒衝到這裡，讓你打開地下室的門，但是你堅守職責，一直在裝傻，於是被打了一頓，然後他們就把你丟在這裡等死？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......差不多是這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "等等，你們怎麼知道有地下室的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "你中計了，其實我們是暴徒們的後手，專程來套你的話的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "什麼？？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "科茨！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "不要生氣，我只是活躍一下氣氛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你們......你們到底是做什麼的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "別擔心，寇恩小姐他們是好人，他們一直在保護感染者社區的居民。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "感染者社區也被襲擊了？？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這......都亂套了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "領主衛隊呢？圖拉領主的衛隊呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "領主衛隊一直沒有出現，他們可能也遇到了麻煩......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "看門人先生，我們需要你的幫助。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但是我能幫上什麼呢？我現在站都站不起來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "得了病的鎮民們也被襲擊了，感染者社區的人員和建築都損失慘重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "我們需要你打開安全屋，讓他們躲在這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "相對的，我們也會保護你的安全，你可以信任我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但是......但是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "依據我和羅德島簽訂的合約，整個安全屋都是羅德島的資產。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......我沒有權力......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......唉......感染者......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "讓他們來吧，丟了工作總比丟了命強。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "謝謝你！奧克芬先生！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
